{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-observability","title":"成本与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/cost-observability","wordCount":1407,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本与可观测性\">成本与可观测性</h1><p>多智能体系统最先教育团队的，往往不是它的能力，而是它的账单。一个在 demo 里跑得漂亮的多体系统，上线后第一个让人惊掉下巴的数字常常是月度 token 账单。本 hub 从<a href=\"../foundations/why-multi-agent\">为什么多智能体</a>开始就反复点到「约十五倍 token」这个代价，这一篇把它正面展开：钱具体烧在哪、怎么算清、怎么控住，以及一个同等重要却常被忽视的话题——怎么给一个分布式的、非确定性的 agent 系统装上眼睛。看不见的系统既没法优化，也没法在烧穿预算前止损。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多体系统的成本由几个相乘的因子决定，理解它们的乘法关系比记单个数字更重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  COST[总成本] --&gt; N[agent 数量]&#10;  COST --&gt; T[每 agent token 量]&#10;  COST --&gt; R[运行次数]&#10;  COST --&gt; P[单 token 价格]&#10;  N --&gt; WARN1[递归 spawn&lt;br/&gt;会让 N 指数膨胀]&#10;  T --&gt; WARN2[全量广播上下文&lt;br/&gt;会让 T 线性膨胀]\">flowchart TD\n  COST[总成本] --&gt; N[agent 数量]\n  COST --&gt; T[每 agent token 量]\n  COST --&gt; R[运行次数]\n  COST --&gt; P[单 token 价格]\n  N --&gt; WARN1[递归 spawn&lt;br/&gt;会让 N 指数膨胀]\n  T --&gt; WARN2[全量广播上下文&lt;br/&gt;会让 T 线性膨胀]</pre><p>先把 2026 年的几个量级摆出来，建立成本直觉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多体 vs 普通聊天 token 倍数</td>\n<td>约 15x</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>agentic 负载 vs 标准聊天算力</td>\n<td>5–30x</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://beam.ai/agentic-insights/anthropics-new-billing-split-reveals-what-ai-agents-actually-cost\">beam.ai</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业 AI 年均支出（2024→2026）</td>\n<td>120 万 → 700 万美元</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://beam.ai/agentic-insights/anthropics-new-billing-split-reveals-what-ai-agents-actually-cost\">beam.ai</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>token 使用量对性能方差的解释力</td>\n<td>约 80%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本模型-把账拆成乘法\">成本模型：把账拆成乘法</h2><p>控成本的第一步是把账拆清。一个多体系统单次运行的 token 成本可以粗略写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cost</mtext><mo>≈</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cost} \\approx \\sum_{i=1}^{N} t_i \\cdot p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是参与的 agent 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 agent 消耗的 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它所用模型的单价。这个简单公式指出三个发力点。</p>\n<p>其一，压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>：防止 <a href=\"../patterns/supervisor-worker\">agent 数量失控</a>，尤其是递归 spawn 导致的指数膨胀——这是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 从加法推向乘方的最危险来源。其二，压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：给每个 agent 最小充分上下文而非全量广播，这正是<a href=\"../coordination/shared-context-memory\">共享上下文与记忆</a>里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i|C_i| \\ll m\\cdot|C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 的直接经济意义。其三，调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：不是每个 agent 都要用最贵的模型，简单的格式校验、测试骨架完全可以用更便宜的小模型，这与<a href=\"../patterns/pipeline-handoff\">流水线</a>里「每棒按需选模型」是同一笔账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控成本的工程闸门\">控成本的工程闸门</h2><p>光有公式不够，得有能在运行时真正卡住成本的闸门。四道闸门值得标配。第一是全局 token 预算：给整次运行设一个硬上限，逼近上限就强制收敛（提前归并已完成的分支、停止派新工人）。第二是 agent 数量上限与委派深度限制：直接掐住 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘方增长，通常只允许一层委派。第三是早停：<a href=\"../patterns/parallel-fanout\">并行扇出</a>里若某分支已给出足够好的答案，不必等其余跑完。第四是缓存：把可复用的中间结果（如对同一文档的解析、对同一工具的相同调用）缓存起来，避免重复花钱——2026 年主流模型 API 普遍支持提示缓存，能显著压低重复上下文的成本。</p>\n<p>这些闸门有一个共同前提：你得先能「看见」当前花了多少、花在哪。没有可观测性，预算闸门就是盲拍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性-给分布式-agent-装眼睛\">可观测性：给分布式 agent 装眼睛</h2><p>可观测性在多体系统里比单体难得多，因为问题是分布式且非确定的——一次失败可能源自三层委派之外某个工人对某个工具的一次误调用，事后想复盘却发现根本不知道当时发生了什么。CrewAI 早期被诟病的正是生产可观测性偏弱，而 LangGraph 受青睐的关键之一就是图结构天然支持审计追踪，详见<a href=\"frameworks-tooling\">框架与工具</a>。</p>\n<p>多体可观测性要抓三类信号。第一类是追踪（trace）：把一次端到端运行的完整 agent 调用树记录下来——谁派了谁、每个 agent 调了哪些工具、输入输出是什么。这棵树就是事后复盘的唯一依据。第二类是成本归因：把 token 花费拆到每个 agent、每个子任务上，才能知道钱烧在哪、哪个环节该优化。第三类是质量信号：记录每个 agent 的产出是否被下游接受、是否触发了回流或冲突，这些是发现<a href=\"pitfalls\">陷阱</a>的早期预警。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  RUN[一次多体运行] --&gt; TR[追踪: 完整调用树&lt;br/&gt;谁派谁 调了什么工具]&#10;  RUN --&gt; AT[成本归因: token&lt;br/&gt;拆到每 agent/子任务]&#10;  RUN --&gt; QS[质量信号: 产出被接受?&lt;br/&gt;触发回流/冲突?]&#10;  TR --&gt; DBG[事后复盘根因]&#10;  AT --&gt; OPT[定位优化点]&#10;  QS --&gt; ALERT[早期预警失败]\">flowchart TD\n  RUN[一次多体运行] --&gt; TR[追踪: 完整调用树&lt;br/&gt;谁派谁 调了什么工具]\n  RUN --&gt; AT[成本归因: token&lt;br/&gt;拆到每 agent/子任务]\n  RUN --&gt; QS[质量信号: 产出被接受?&lt;br/&gt;触发回流/冲突?]\n  TR --&gt; DBG[事后复盘根因]\n  AT --&gt; OPT[定位优化点]\n  QS --&gt; ALERT[早期预警失败]</pre><h2 id=\"把成本和观测连成闭环\">把成本和观测连成闭环</h2><p>成本与可观测性不是两件事，而是一个闭环：观测告诉你钱花在哪、效果如何，预算闸门据此动态收敛，新一轮运行的数据又回到观测里。一个成熟的多体系统应当能回答这类问题——「这次运行哪个 agent 最烧钱且产出最常被丢弃？」答案直接指向该砍的环节。这也呼应了<a href=\"../foundations/why-multi-agent\">为什么多智能体</a>的核心判据：既然 token 解释了约八成性能方差，那么把 token 花在「边际产出最高」的 agent 上、从「花钱却没用」的 agent 上抽走预算，就是多体优化的主战场。没有可观测性，这场优化无从谈起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多体成本量级：约 15x token、5–30x 算力，企业 AI 年均支出两年从 120 万跳到 700 万美元。</li>\n<li>成本拆成乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i t_i p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，三个发力点：压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（防递归 spawn）、压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（最小上下文）、调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（按需选模型）。</li>\n<li>四道运行时闸门：全局 token 预算、agent 数/委派深度上限、早停、缓存（含提示缓存）。</li>\n<li>多体可观测性抓三类信号：完整调用树追踪、token 成本归因、产出质量信号；LangGraph 的图结构天然利于审计。</li>\n<li>成本与观测构成闭环——观测定位高耗低产的 agent，预算据此收敛，把 token 投到边际产出最高处。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本与可观测性","id":"成本与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本模型：把账拆成乘法","id":"成本模型-把账拆成乘法"},{"level":2,"text":"控成本的工程闸门","id":"控成本的工程闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性：给分布式 agent 装眼睛","id":"可观测性-给分布式-agent-装眼睛"},{"level":2,"text":"把成本和观测连成闭环","id":"把成本和观测连成闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"框架与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/frameworks-tooling"},"next":{"title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/pitfalls"}}